### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@accessToken = COLLE_TON_ACCESS_TOKEN_ICI

### 1. Mes notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2. Uniquement les non lues
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/mine?unread=true
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 3. Compteur non lues
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/mine/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4. Marquer une notification comme lue
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/notifications/NOTIFICATION_ID/read
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5. Tout marquer comme lu
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/notifications/mine/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}